; CS-TAIL: Invalid address in LBR record at line [[#LINE]]: 0x5005c8/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0 0x50062f/0x5005b0/P/-/-/0 0xinvalid/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0 0x5005c8/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0
; BAD-PREFIX: Invalid address in LBR record at line 6: 0x700000/0x700004/P/-/-/0 0xinvalid/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0
; BAD-IP: Invalid address in LBR record at line 2: 100 3.000000: invalid 0x5005c8/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0 0x50062f/0x5005b0/P/-/-/0
; LEGACY-TAIL: Invalid address in LBR record at line 2: 5005dc 0x5005c8/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0 0x50062f/0x5005b0/P/-/-/0 0xinvalid/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0 0x5005c8/0x5005dc/P/-/-/0

